{
    "title": "Live football TV",
    "description": "\ud83c\udfc6 ultimate app for Live Match Results and Statistics! \ud83c\udfc0\u26bd\ud83c\udfbe\ud83c\udfc8\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udea8 WARNING: This application is designed to provide information about sports matches and may contain non-final results. It is an enjoyable application for sports enthusiasts. Our application has been meticulously crafted to comply with Google policies. The content in this application is provided by reliable third-party data providers over whom we have no direct control. However, if you detect any violation of Google policies or copyright infringement, please contact us at copyright@findy360.com for necessary actions to be taken. Please note that while we strive to ensure compliance with Google policies, we are not responsible for the accuracy and precision of the content. Please use our application with this disclaimer in mind. We wish you enjoyable sports experiences!\r\n\r\n* Our application covers all major and minor sports events including global football, basketball, volleyball, tennis, and more.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n* All Matches - You can check real-time updates of all matches today and view match information on the calendar.\r\n\r\n* Ongoing Matches - Stay updated with the latest scores and results from all sports events around the world.\r\n\r\n* Favorites - By pressing the Follow button, you can receive the most up-to-date information about your favorite teams and matches.\r\n\r\n* Leagues - A comprehensive database covers sports data from more than 160 countries, allowing you to obtain information on various topics including various matches, teams, and statistics.\r\n\r\n* Chat: Meet sports enthusiasts from around the world and make sports even more enjoyable.\r\n\r\n* Language - Support for 33 different languages.\r\n\r\n* Interactive Experience - Simple and easy to use.\r\n\r\n* Dark mode or device mode as per preference.\r\n\r\nContact Channels:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce7 Contact us for collaboration:\r\n\r\nCollaboration: business@findy360.com\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce7 Contact us for support:\r\n\r\nSupport: official@findy360.com\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce7 Contact us for Copyright:\r\n\r\nCopyright: copyright@findy360.com\r\n\r\n\u260e\ufe0f Contact Phone: +1(322) 265-2894\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfe2 Address: 8 THE GREEN STE 11111 DOVER DE 19901 Delaware / United States",
